WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
[Soft piano music]

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:10.000
Hi my love. I made this for you to say thank you and happy birthday.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:18.000
You are the most beautiful part of my every day — your laugh, your kindness, and your courage.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:26.000
I remember the first time we met and how my world changed in a single moment.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Every day with you feels like a promise I never want to break.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:44.000
So for today, and all the days that follow, I hope you know how deeply you are loved.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:50.000
[Piano swells]

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:57.000
Happy birthday, my forever. — With all my heart.
